      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777714751497,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. User types query\n   ↓\n2. Nginx → FastAPI\n   ↓\n3. CopilotRouter\n   classifies intent\n   ↓\n4. supervisor_node\n   picks agents\n   ↓\n5. asyncio.gather()\n   fans out to all\n   active agents\n   ↓\n6. Each agent calls:\n   • Live data tools\n   • RAG pipeline\n   ↓\n7. HyDE → dense +\n   sparse search\n   → Cohere rerank\n   → parent-child\n   ↓\n8. merge_node dedup\n   + sort by score\n   ↓\n9. context_builder\n   token budgets\n   ↓\n10. LLM streams tokens\n    via SSE\n    ↓\n11. UI renders cites\n    + stock panel",
      "fontSize": 13.50721153806825,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User types query\n   ↓\n2. Nginx → FastAPI\n   ↓\n3. CopilotRouter\n   classifies intent\n   ↓\n4. supervisor_node\n   picks agents\n   ↓\n5. asyncio.gather()\n   fans out to all\n   active agents\n   ↓\n6. Each agent calls:\n   • Live data tools\n   • RAG pipeline\n   ↓\n7. HyDE → dense +\n   sparse search\n   → Cohere rerank\n   → parent-child\n   ↓\n8. merge_node dedup\n   + sort by score\n   ↓\n9. context_builder\n   token budgets\n   ↓\n10. LLM streams tokens\n    via SSE\n    ↓\n11. UI renders cites\n    + stock panel",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1J",
      "autoResize": true
